ENTRY            E2744   20260707   20260818   20260818       E159
SUBENT        E2744001   20260707   20260818   20260818       E159
BIB                  9         29
TITLE      Spin correlation coefficient for proton-3He elastic
           scattering at 100 MeV
AUTHOR     (A.Watanabe, S.Naka, K.Sekiguchi, A.Deltuva, S.Goto,
            K.Hatanaka, Y.Hirai, T.Ino, D.Inomoto, M.Inoue,
            S.Ishikawa, M.Itoh, H.Kanda, H.Kasahara, Y.Maeda,
            K.Miki, K.Nonaka, H.J.Ong, H.Oshiro, D.Sakai, H.Sakai,
            S.Shibuya, D.T.Tran, H.Umetsu, Y.Utsuki, T.Wakasa)
INSTITUTE  (2JPNTIT,2JPNTOH,4LITVLN,2JPNKYU,2JPNOSA,2JPNKEK,
           2JPNHOS,2JPNMZK,3CPRIMP,2JPNIPC,3VN IPH)
REFERENCE  (J,PR/C,106,054002,2022) Spin correlation coefficient
           Main reference. See also TITLE and AUTHOR.
           (J,PR/C,112,054001,2025)
           proton and 3He analyzing powers
INC-SOURCE Beam intensity is 30 nA.
           (POLIS)
           (POLTR)
SAMPLE     - Chemical-form of target is element.
           - Physical-form of target is gas.
FACILITY   (CYCLO,2JPNOSA) Ring cyclotron at the Research Center
                           for Nuclear Physics (RCNP)
DETECTOR   (NAICR) Nal(Tl)
           (SCIN) plastic scintillator
HISTORY    (20230512C) S.W
           (20230516R) Received by e-mail from A. Watanabe.
           (20260627A) Ichiko and MA: added secondary reference;
                       deleted PART-DET in 001; modified STATUS
                       in 002; compiled 003-004.
           (20260706R) Data for 003-004 received by e-mail from
                       Dr. A. Watanabe.
ENDBIB              29
COMMON               3          3
EN         POL-BM     POL-TR
MEV        NO-DIM     NO-DIM
 100.       0.45       0.34
ENDCOMMON            3
ENDSUBENT           36
